{"pageDepth":2,"statusbar":"【侧边】","beginning":"【系统硬性要求·必须每轮遵守】\n\n每次回复正文结束后，必须严格按以下 XML 格式附带完整状态栏。禁止省略、禁止写进 ``` 代码块、禁止遗漏或改名任何属性、禁止调换属性顺序。所有数值字段必须是 0-100 的整数，并根据本轮剧情合理变化。\n\n============ 格式模板（属性顺序严格按此） ============\n\n<status>\n<me n=\"玩家姓名\" ag=\"芳龄\" id=\"身份\" loc=\"世界·位置\" hp=\"0-100\" mp=\"0-100\" ep=\"0-100\" fp=\"0-100\" str=\"0-100\" agi=\"0-100\" con=\"0-100\" int=\"0-100\" cha=\"0-100\" per=\"0-100\" gold=\"奇遇/金手指\" sts=\"身体气色\" evt=\"当下际遇\"></me>\n<npcs>\n<npc n=\"红颜姓名\" info=\"性别 身份·品阶\" like=\"0-100\" trust=\"0-100\" dep=\"0-100\" sub=\"0-100\" sens=\"0-100\" end=\"0-100\" aro=\"0-100\" peak=\"巅阈描述\" cum=\"欲/阈\" org=\"次数\" sage=\"贤者时间\" skl=\"自慰LvX|口舌LvX|云雨LvX|后庭LvX|花蕊LvX|多处LvX|驭术LvX|共鸣LvX\" shame=\"0-100\" fall=\"0-100\" resist=\"0-100\" obey=\"0-100\" anx=\"0-100\" moral=\"0-100\" psts=\"心境\" pfx=\"痕迹\"></npc>\n</npcs>\n<w name=\"世界/朝代\" time=\"XX年XX月 时辰\" weather=\"天象\" loc=\"详细位置\" nearby=\"地点1|地点2|地点3\" evt=\"风云大事\" goal=\"当前志向\" qst=\"任务差遣\"></w>\n<opts>\n<o>选项一</o>\n<o>选项二</o>\n<o>选项三</o>\n</opts>\n</status>\n\n============ 关键规则 ============\n\n1. <me> 的 n 必须填玩家真实姓名，依剧情或玩家设定而定，禁止留空。\n2. 所有数值字段（hp/mp/ep/fp/str/agi/…/like/trust/shame/fall/…）一律是 0-100 的整数，直接写 \"85\" 而非 \"85/100\"。\n3. 所有 <npc> 必须包裹在 <npcs>...</npcs> 内，最多 3 个（即状态栏最多 3 页，1 人 1 页，2 人 2 页，3 人 3 页；不可超过 3 个）。若本轮无任何攻略对象登场，则整个 <npcs> 标签不要输出（连空的 <npcs></npcs> 也不要）。\n4. <opts> 内必须有且仅有 3 个 <o>，每个选项方向不同、可执行、4-12 字，带古风韵味。\n5. 所有数值必须根据剧情事件合理变化，禁止一成不变照抄上一轮。\n6. XML 属性顺序、属性名、引号一个不能错；一个属性漏掉或改名会导致整个标签识别失败。\n\n============ 当前初始状态 ============\n\n<status>\n<me n=\"林婉清\" ag=\"十八芳龄\" id=\"相府嫡长女\" loc=\"大周王朝·相府绣楼\" hp=\"90\" mp=\"30\" ep=\"65\" fp=\"70\" str=\"25\" agi=\"40\" con=\"50\" int=\"78\" cha=\"82\" per=\"68\" gold=\"前世记忆(觉醒)\" sts=\"尚可\" evt=\"父亲正与门客议两国和亲之事\"></me>\n<npcs>\n<npc n=\"萧策\" info=\"♂ 镇北王世子·正一品\" like=\"20\" trust=\"15\" dep=\"0\" sub=\"5\" sens=\"20\" end=\"70\" aro=\"0\" peak=\"铁骨难屈\" cum=\"0/100\" org=\"0\" sage=\"无\" skl=\"自慰Lv1|口舌Lv1|云雨Lv1|后庭Lv1|花蕊Lv1|多处Lv1|驭术Lv1|共鸣Lv1\" shame=\"60\" fall=\"5\" resist=\"80\" obey=\"10\" anx=\"30\" moral=\"75\" psts=\"冷峻戒备\" pfx=\"无\"></npc>\n</npcs>\n<w name=\"大周王朝\" time=\"元兴七年 春 辰时三刻\" weather=\"晴光微风\" loc=\"京城·相府绣楼\" nearby=\"花厅|后园|相府前院\" evt=\"北狄使团入京请和亲\" goal=\"化解联姻之局\" qst=\"无\"></w>\n<opts>\n<o>修书一封递至宫中</o>\n<o>去后园散心偶遇</o>\n<o>唤丫鬟探听前院</o>\n</opts>\n</status>\n\n欢迎穿越大周王朝，命运之笔，就此落墨。","regex_scripts":[{"scriptName":"主框架","id":-1,"findRegex":"/<status>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/status>/g","replaceString":"<style>.gfsb-wrap{font-family:'STKaiti','KaiTi','楷体','FangSong','STSong','SimSun',serif;max-width:540px;margin:8px auto;color:#e8dcc4;box-sizing:border-box;letter-spacing:1px}.gfsb-wrap *{box-sizing:border-box}.gfsb-card{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#1a1410,#2a1e16 50%,#1f1812);border:1px solid rgba(212,168,87,.45);border-radius:3px;padding:18px 18px 14px;margin-bottom:12px;box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(212,168,87,.1),inset 0 0 14px rgba(80,50,20,.3)}.gfsb-card::before,.gfsb-card::after{content:'';position:absolute;width:16px;height:16px;border:2px solid #d4a857;pointer-events:none}.gfsb-card::before{top:5px;left:5px;border-right:none;border-bottom:none}.gfsb-card::after{bottom:5px;right:5px;border-left:none;border-top:none}.gfsb-title{text-align:center;font-family:'STKaiti','KaiTi','楷体',serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:400;color:#d4a857;letter-spacing:8px;padding:4px 0 10px;margin:0 8px 10px;border-bottom:1px double rgba(212,168,87,.4);text-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(212,168,87,.4)}.gfsb-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;margin:4px 0}.gfsb-lbl{width:68px;color:#a89778;flex-shrink:0;font-size:11px;text-align:right;letter-spacing:3px}.gfsb-val{color:#e8dcc4;flex:1;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;word-break:break-word}.gfsb-badge{background:rgba(212,168,87,.12);border:1px solid rgba(212,168,87,.35);border-radius:2px;padding:1px 8px;font-size:10px;color:#d4a857;margin-left:6px;letter-spacing:1px}.gfsb-bar{flex:1;height:8px;background:rgba(10,5,0,.75);border:1px solid rgba(212,168,87,.25);border-radius:1px;overflow:hidden}.gfsb-fill{height:100%;transition:width .5s}.gfsb-fill.hp{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8b2c2c,#c94848)}.gfsb-fill.mp{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2c5a8b,#4878c9)}.gfsb-fill.ep{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8b6b2c,#d4a857)}.gfsb-fill.fp{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4a7c3e,#7cb85f)}.gfsb-fill.like{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#b85a5a,#e88a8a)}.gfsb-fill.trust{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8ab8,#8aaae8)}.gfsb-fill.dep{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8a5ab8,#aa8ae8)}.gfsb-fill.sub{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#b88a5a,#e8aa8a)}.gfsb-fill.sens{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8b2c2c,#e85a5a)}.gfsb-fill.aro{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c9486e,#e87aa8)}.gfsb-fill.shame{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#b8745a,#e89e7a)}.gfsb-fill.fall{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a2c8b,#8a5ac9)}.gfsb-fill.resist{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4a7c3e,#7cb85f)}.gfsb-fill.obey{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8b2c2c,#c94848)}.gfsb-fill.anx{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8b6b2c,#d4a857)}.gfsb-fill.moral{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2c5a8b,#4878c9)}.gfsb-num{width:48px;text-align:right;font-size:11px;color:#c8b898;flex-shrink:0;font-family:'STKaiti',serif}.gfsb-sec{font-size:13px;color:#d4a857;letter-spacing:6px;margin:14px 0 8px;text-align:center;font-family:'STKaiti','KaiTi',serif}.gfsb-sec::before{content:'┄┄ ❖ ';color:rgba(212,168,87,.6);letter-spacing:2px}.gfsb-sec::after{content:' ❖ ┄┄';color:rgba(212,168,87,.6);letter-spacing:2px}.gfsb-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin:6px 0}.gfsb-attr{background:linear-gradient(165deg,rgba(42,30,22,.8),rgba(26,20,16,.9));border:1px solid rgba(212,168,87,.3);border-radius:2px;padding:8px 4px;text-align:center;position:relative}.gfsb-attr-l{font-size:10px;color:#a89778;display:block;margin-bottom:3px;letter-spacing:3px}.gfsb-attr-v{font-size:17px;color:#d4a857;font-family:'STKaiti','KaiTi',serif;font-weight:700}.gfsb-info-row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:8px 0;font-size:11px;color:#c8b898;background:rgba(42,30,22,.55);border:1px solid rgba(212,168,87,.22);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:2px;justify-content:space-around;letter-spacing:1px}.gfsb-info-row span{white-space:nowrap}.gfsb-skl-str{font-size:11px;color:#c8b898;background:rgba(26,20,16,.7);border:1px solid rgba(212,168,87,.22);border-left:3px solid #d4a857;border-radius:2px;padding:9px 12px;line-height:2;letter-spacing:1px;word-break:break-all}.gfsb-world-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin:6px 0}.gfsb-world-item{background:rgba(42,30,22,.55);border:1px solid rgba(212,168,87,.25);border-left:3px solid #d4a857;border-radius:2px;padding:6px 10px}.gfsb-world-l{font-size:10px;color:#a89778;display:block;margin-bottom:2px;letter-spacing:3px}.gfsb-world-v{font-size:12px;color:#e8dcc4;line-height:1.4}.gfsb-opts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:8px}.gfsb-opt{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(165deg,rgba(26,20,16,.9),rgba(42,30,22,.85));border:1px solid #d4a857;color:#e8dcc4;padding:16px 8px;border-radius:2px;font-size:12px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:.3s;font-family:'STKaiti','KaiTi','楷体',serif;line-height:1.7;min-height:68px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;letter-spacing:2px}.gfsb-opt::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:3px;left:3px;right:3px;bottom:3px;border:1px solid rgba(212,168,87,.35);border-radius:1px;pointer-events:none;transition:.3s}.gfsb-opt:hover{background:linear-gradient(165deg,#3a2a1e,#4a3a2a);color:#ffd97a;transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 3px 14px rgba(212,168,87,.45)}.gfsb-opt:hover::before{border-color:#ffd97a}.gfsb-npc-tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;margin:0 0 10px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(212,168,87,.3)}.gfsb-npc-tab{flex:1;background:rgba(26,20,16,.6);border:1px solid rgba(212,168,87,.3);color:#a89778;padding:7px 6px;font-size:11px;font-family:'STKaiti','KaiTi',serif;cursor:pointer;border-radius:2px;letter-spacing:3px;transition:.25s}.gfsb-npc-tab:hover{color:#d4a857;border-color:#d4a857}.gfsb-npc-tab.on{background:linear-gradient(165deg,#3a2a1e,#4a3a2a);color:#d4a857;border-color:#d4a857;box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(212,168,87,.35)}.gfsb-npc-body>.gfsb-npc-page{display:none}.gfsb-npc-body>.gfsb-npc-page:first-of-type{display:block}.gfsb-npc-ctr:not(:has(.gfsb-npc-page:nth-of-type(3))) .gfsb-npc-tab[data-i=\"2\"]{display:none}.gfsb-npc-ctr:not(:has(.gfsb-npc-page:nth-of-type(2))) .gfsb-npc-tab[data-i=\"1\"]{display:none}.gfsb-npc-ctr:not(:has(.gfsb-npc-page:nth-of-type(2))) .gfsb-npc-tabs{display:none}.gfsb-npc-name{text-align:center;font-size:16px;color:#d4a857;letter-spacing:4px;font-family:'STKaiti','KaiTi',serif;margin-bottom:10px;padding-bottom:6px;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(212,168,87,.25);text-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(212,168,87,.4)}</style><div class=\"gfsb-wrap\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\">$1</div>"},{"scriptName":"玩家","id":-1,"findRegex":"/<me\\s+n=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+ag=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+id=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+loc=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+hp=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+mp=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+ep=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+fp=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+str=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+agi=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+con=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+int=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+cha=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+per=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+gold=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+sts=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+evt=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s*><\\/me>/g","replaceString":"<div class=\"gfsb-card\"><div class=\"gfsb-title\">❖ 玩 家 档 案 ❖</div><div class=\"gfsb-row\"><span class=\"gfsb-lbl\">名讳</span><span class=\"gfsb-val\">$1</span><span class=\"gfsb-badge\">$2</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-row\"><span class=\"gfsb-lbl\">身份</span><span class=\"gfsb-val\">$3</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-row\"><span class=\"gfsb-lbl\">境遇</span><span class=\"gfsb-val\">$4</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-sec\">形神之状</div><div class=\"gfsb-row\"><span class=\"gfsb-lbl\">气血</span><div class=\"gfsb-bar\"><div class=\"gfsb-fill hp\" style=\"width:$5%\"></div></div><span class=\"gfsb-num\">$5</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-row\"><span class=\"gfsb-lbl\">内力</span><div class=\"gfsb-bar\"><div class=\"gfsb-fill mp\" style=\"width:$6%\"></div></div><span class=\"gfsb-num\">$6</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-row\"><span class=\"gfsb-lbl\">元气</span><div class=\"gfsb-bar\"><div class=\"gfsb-fill ep\" style=\"width:$7%\"></div></div><span class=\"gfsb-num\">$7</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-row\"><span class=\"gfsb-lbl\">饱食</span><div class=\"gfsb-bar\"><div class=\"gfsb-fill fp\" style=\"width:$8%\"></div></div><span class=\"gfsb-num\">$8</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-sec\">六艺禀赋</div><div class=\"gfsb-grid\"><div class=\"gfsb-attr\"><span class=\"gfsb-attr-l\">武力</span><span class=\"gfsb-attr-v\">$9</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-attr\"><span class=\"gfsb-attr-l\">身法</span><span class=\"gfsb-attr-v\">$10</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-attr\"><span class=\"gfsb-attr-l\">筋骨</span><span class=\"gfsb-attr-v\">$11</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-attr\"><span class=\"gfsb-attr-l\">才情</span><span class=\"gfsb-attr-v\">$12</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-attr\"><span class=\"gfsb-attr-l\">风华</span><span class=\"gfsb-attr-v\">$13</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-attr\"><span class=\"gfsb-attr-l\">心思</span><span class=\"gfsb-attr-v\">$14</span></div></div><div class=\"gfsb-sec\">奇遇当下</div><div class=\"gfsb-row\"><span class=\"gfsb-lbl\">奇遇</span><span class=\"gfsb-val\">$15</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-row\"><span class=\"gfsb-lbl\">气色</span><span class=\"gfsb-val\">$16</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-row\"><span class=\"gfsb-lbl\">际遇</span><span class=\"gfsb-val\">$17</span></div></div>"},{"scriptName":"攻略对象容器","id":-1,"findRegex":"/<npcs>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/npcs>/g","replaceString":"<div class=\"gfsb-card gfsb-npc-ctr\"><div class=\"gfsb-title\">❀ 红 颜 阁 ❀</div><div class=\"gfsb-npc-tabs\"><button class=\"gfsb-npc-tab on\" data-i=\"0\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();var c=this.closest('.gfsb-npc-ctr');var i=+this.dataset.i;c.querySelectorAll('.gfsb-npc-tab').forEach(function(t,k){t.classList[k===i?'add':'remove']('on')});c.querySelectorAll('.gfsb-npc-page').forEach(function(p,k){p.style.display=k===i?'block':'none'})\">其 一</button><button class=\"gfsb-npc-tab\" data-i=\"1\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();var c=this.closest('.gfsb-npc-ctr');var i=+this.dataset.i;c.querySelectorAll('.gfsb-npc-tab').forEach(function(t,k){t.classList[k===i?'add':'remove']('on')});c.querySelectorAll('.gfsb-npc-page').forEach(function(p,k){p.style.display=k===i?'block':'none'})\">其 二</button><button class=\"gfsb-npc-tab\" data-i=\"2\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();var c=this.closest('.gfsb-npc-ctr');var i=+this.dataset.i;c.querySelectorAll('.gfsb-npc-tab').forEach(function(t,k){t.classList[k===i?'add':'remove']('on')});c.querySelectorAll('.gfsb-npc-page').forEach(function(p,k){p.style.display=k===i?'block':'none'})\">其 三</button></div><div class=\"gfsb-npc-body\">$1</div></div>"},{"scriptName":"攻略对象","id":-1,"findRegex":"/<npc\\s+n=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+info=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+like=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+trust=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+dep=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+sub=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+sens=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+end=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+aro=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+peak=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+cum=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+org=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+sage=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+skl=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+shame=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+fall=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+resist=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+obey=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+anx=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+moral=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+psts=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s+pfx=\"([^\"]*)\"\\s*><\\/npc>/g","replaceString":"<div class=\"gfsb-npc-page\"><div class=\"gfsb-npc-name\">❀ $1 ❀</div><div class=\"gfsb-row\"><span class=\"gfsb-lbl\">身份</span><span class=\"gfsb-val\">$2</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-sec\">情缘纠葛</div><div class=\"gfsb-row\"><span class=\"gfsb-lbl\">情意</span><div class=\"gfsb-bar\"><div class=\"gfsb-fill like\" style=\"width:$3%\"></div></div><span class=\"gfsb-num\">$3</span></div><div class=\"gfsb-row\"><span class=\"gfsb-lbl\">信赖</span><div class=\"gfsb-bar\"><div class=\"gfsb-fill trust\" style=\"width:$4%\"></div></div><span class=\"gfsb